        description: "Deep screening beyond initial sanctions check (E2E-01 Step 6): PEP (Politically Exposed Person) check on directors, adverse media screening, ultimate beneficial owner (UBO) verification, country risk assessment. Required for compliance with FATF recommendations and local AML regulations.",
