        description: "Credit manager reviews and approves credit limit based on: annual volume × average rate, payment terms, credit score, industry benchmarks. Delegation: up to $50K (Credit Analyst), $50K-$250K (Credit Manager), >$250K (CFO). AI provides recommended limit with risk exposure analysis.",
        assignedRole: "Credit Manager / CFO",
