        description: "Suspend or reduce credit limit for customers with persistent non-payment. Suspension levels: reduce limit to current outstanding only (no new bookings until balance reduces), reduce to zero (full suspension — all new business on prepayment only), or temporary increase (if customer has a credible payment plan and commercial value justifies risk). System automatically: blocks new booking confirmations (booking system checks credit before confirmation), notifies booking team and agents of hold status, and records credit action history. Reinstatement: only after overdue cleared and reviewed by credit committee. For suspended customers: any existing bookings in pipeline need individual review (hold, cancel, or allow to proceed).",
