        description: "Handle customer complaints related to collection actions. Common complaints: invoice is incorrect (wrong amount, wrong charges — route to invoice correction), service was unsatisfactory (late delivery, damaged cargo — route to claims process), payment was already made (customer claims they paid — verify with bank, check for misapplied payment), dispute on terms (customer says terms were different from what we're applying — verify contract), and overreaction complaint (customer objects to hold/suspension — assess if actions were proportionate). Resolution may affect collections: if complaint is valid, adjust invoices and recalculate overdue amount. If complaint is a delaying tactic: document assessment and continue collections.",
