        description: "Apply received payments to outstanding overdue invoices. Match payments using: payment reference, amount, and customer identification. Priority: apply to oldest overdue invoices first (FIFO) unless customer specifies otherwise. Handle: partial payments (allocate to specific invoices per customer instruction or FIFO), payment plan installments (allocate per agreed schedule), interest payments (apply to interest account, not principal), and post-dated checks (record as received, apply on maturity date). After payment application: update collections status (if all overdue cleared — remove from dunning, lift booking hold, reinstate credit limit). Notify collections team of payment receipt for active cases.",
