        description: "Confirm all required permits have been received from authorities before proceeding with cargo operations. Verify: permits cover the actual cargo dimensions and weight (authorities may issue permits for lesser dimensions), permit dates cover the planned transport/loading dates, any conditions attached are achievable (police escort requirements, time-of-day restrictions, route restrictions), and permits are properly signed and stamped. If any permit is denied: evaluate alternatives (different route, different port, different transport mode). All permits must be in hand before cargo gates into terminal.",
