        description: "For each approved repo move, select specific transport mode and carrier. Options: ocean vessel (cheapest for long-haul, 3-30 days), rail (medium cost, 2-5 days for domestic), truck (highest cost, fastest for short-haul <300km), and barge (cheapest inland waterway). For each move: get carrier quotes, compare cost and transit time, select optimal carrier. Book transport per approved budget.",
