        description: "Book trucking for short-haul empty repositioning (typically <300km depot-to-depot or depot-to-port). Select from contracted trucking companies based on: availability, rate, and service quality. Coordinate pickup at surplus depot and delivery at deficit depot or port. For bulk repo moves (>10 containers): negotiate volume rates.",
