        description: "Book rail transport for long-haul inland repositioning (typically 300km+). Rail is cost-effective for bulk empty moves between major inland depots and ports. Book slots on scheduled container rail services. Coordinate first/last mile trucking to/from rail terminals. Rail transit typically 2-5 days for domestic moves.",
