        description: "Repositioned empty container arrives and gates in at destination depot. System records: container number, gate-in time, transport mode, origin depot, and visual condition (good order or damaged). Container enters depot inventory as 'available' (if good order) or 'under inspection' (if damage observed). Gate-in event triggers repo move completion in tracking system.",
