        description: "Detailed inspection of repositioned empty containers per IICL (Institute of International Container Lessors) standards. Check: structural integrity (walls, floor, roof, doors), weathertightness (no holes, seals intact), cleanliness (food-grade if needed), refrigeration unit (if reefer — temperature test), and CSC plate validity. Containers with damage are routed to M&R (maintenance and repair) before being made available. For leased containers: damage affects lessor liability.",
