        description: "Update depot inventory with repositioned containers now available for use. Recalculate: available inventory by type, days of supply, and surplus/deficit position. The repo move should have improved the imbalance — verify deficit locations now have adequate supply. Update availability for booking system so export bookings can be confirmed against the new inventory. Trigger next week's forecast recalculation.",
