        description: "Compare actual repositioning costs against approved budget. Analyze variance by: transport mode (vessel vs truck vs rail costs), route (which routes cost more than planned), volume (more or fewer containers moved than planned), and rate (carrier rates vs contracted rates). Identify: cost overruns for investigation, savings opportunities, and budget forecast accuracy for future planning.",
