        description: "Update repositioning performance KPIs. Key metrics: imbalance reduction % (did the repo plan improve the surplus/deficit?), cost per TEU repositioned (by mode and overall), street turn rate (% of empties reused without depot return), forecast accuracy (predicted vs actual demand), transit time performance (actual vs planned), and repo budget variance. Trend analysis over rolling 12 weeks to identify improvement or deterioration.",
