        description: "Add accepted leased containers to operational fleet inventory. For each container: create equipment record with lease reference, lessor name, on-hire date, lease expiry date, per-diem rate, and DPP status. Mark containers as 'available' in depot inventory for booking allocation. Tag as 'leased' (distinct from 'owned') — this affects: cost allocation (per-diem charged to voyages using the container), M&R authorization (lessor approval may be needed for major repairs), and off-hire planning (must return before lease expiry). Update fleet composition dashboard with new lease addition.",
