        description: "Continuous tracking of leased container locations and utilization throughout the lease period. Track: current location (depot, vessel, inland transport), status (loaded, empty, in repair, idle), utilization rate (days loaded ÷ total days), geographic distribution (are containers moving outside allowed trading areas?), and time-to-return (days until lease expiry). Alert for: containers approaching lease expiry (90/60/30 day warnings), containers in restricted geographic areas (some leases restrict trading regions), containers idle >30 days (incurring per-diem without generating revenue), and containers lost or unlocated >7 days. Lessor reporting: provide periodic inventory reports as required by lease agreement.",
