        description: "Monitor condition of leased containers throughout the lease period. At each depot interaction (gate-in/out): record condition observations. For major damage: determine liability — IICL standards define lessee responsibility (handling damage, structural damage during lessee's custody) vs normal wear (paint fading, minor dents, floor scuffing). For repairs: lessee handles routine repairs per IICL lessee clauses; major structural repairs may need lessor pre-approval. Track M&R spend per container against DPP coverage (if elected). For reefers: monitor pre-trip inspection results — failing units need immediate repair to avoid spoilage claims. Build repair history for each container — this affects off-hire cost.",
