        description: "Set cargo cut-off times for feeder service at each spoke port. Cut-offs must work backwards from: feeder departure → sailing time to hub → hub cargo handling → mainline departure. Typically: documentation cut-off 24h before feeder ETD, VGM cut-off 12h, physical gate-in cut-off 6h. Spoke port cut-offs are tighter than mainline due to smaller buffer. Publish cut-offs to agents and customers.",
