        description: "Assign specific feeder vessel to rotation. Consider: vessel capacity vs demand (typically 500-2000 TEU for feeders), draft restrictions at spoke ports (feeders often call shallow draft ports), reefer plug capacity, fuel efficiency at feeder operating speeds (10-14 knots), and charter availability. If demand exceeds single vessel capacity, arrange extra loader or upgrade vessel size.",
