        description: "Generate stowage plan for feeder voyage. Feeder stowage is complex due to multi-port discharge/load pattern: cargo loaded at hub must be stowed for efficient spoke port discharge (minimize restows), spoke port cargo loaded for efficient hub discharge on return. Consider: stability on smaller vessels (more sensitive to weight distribution), reefer allocation, DG segregation, and stack weight limits. Target: zero restows at spoke ports.",
