        description: "Record Remaining on Board (ROB) bunker quantities at delivery per CP bunker clause. Typically owner sells bunkers to charterer at agreed price (last purchase price or current market rate per CP terms). Calculate bunker value for hire statement. Record fuel grades (VLSFO, MGO per ISO 8217), quantities per tank, and agreed price per MT.",
