        description: "Notify H&M (Hull & Machinery) insurers and P&I Club of planned dry dock. H&M may require: survey scope details, yard name and location, classification society involvement. Some H&M policies require surveyor attendance for hull treatment works. P&I notified for liability coverage during yard stay. Update insurance risk profile.",
