        description: "Approve any additional works discovered during dry dock (common: unexpected steel wastage, valve repairs, Class-imposed findings). Each additional item must be: justified (photo evidence), quoted by yard, and compared against doing the work now vs deferring. Scope creep target: < 15% of original budget. Each addition requires formal change order.",
