        description: "Analyze total dry dock cost against approved budget. Break down variances by category: yard works (original scope vs actual), additional works (scope creep), owner-supplied items, subcontractors, superintendent expenses, and positioning voyage costs. Calculate total cost per calendar day in yard for benchmarking against industry average.",
