          "Vessel Requirement per Alternative (number of vessels needed for weekly/fortnightly frequency)",
          "TEU-Mile Cost Efficiency Ranking",
          "Port Coverage vs Demand Map Overlap Score",
          "Recommended Rotation with Rationale",
