        description: "Generate intercompany elimination entries for consolidated reporting. Identify and eliminate: intercompany revenue/expenses (services between group entities — e.g., Qatar head office charges management fees to UAE and India subsidiaries), intercompany receivables/payables (must net to zero at group level), intercompany profit in inventory (if one entity sells goods/services to another at markup), and intercompany dividends. For each intercompany pair: verify balances agree (both sides record the same amount — if not, identify timing differences or errors). Post elimination entries to consolidation adjustments ledger (not to individual entity books). Handle: different functional currencies between entities (elimination in group reporting currency).",
