        description: "Generate management-ready budget variance monitoring report with commentary. For each material variance: auto-generate preliminary explanation based on: known operational events (vessel off-hire, blank sailings, extra loader), market changes (bunker price movement, FX rate changes, rate increases), and one-off items (insurance claim receipts, legal settlements). Format report with: executive summary (key variances and overall P&L vs budget), traffic light indicators (green/amber/red per budget line), trend charts (monthly actual vs budget), and action items (where variances indicate corrective action needed). Report distributed to: budget holders (for their sections) and finance management (full report).",
        assignedRole: "Budget Reporting AI Agent",
