        description: "Budget holders provide explanations for material variances in their areas. AI-generated preliminary commentary reviewed and supplemented with: specific operational context (why did this happen?), one-time vs recurring assessment (will this variance continue?), corrective actions taken or planned, and revised forecast (does this variance change full-year outlook?). Finance collects all explanations and validates: are explanations reasonable and supported by evidence? Do the explanations for individual variances reconcile to the total variance? Are corrective actions credible? This step is critical for management accountability and forecast accuracy.",
