        description: "Generate balance sheet (statement of financial position) per IFRS. Structure: assets (vessels and equipment at NBV, right-of-use assets, containers, receivables, cash, prepayments, inventories), liabilities (payables, lease liabilities, tax provisions, borrowings, accruals), and equity (share capital, retained earnings, FX translation reserve). For shipping: vessels are typically the largest asset — show NBV with gross cost and accumulated depreciation. Leased containers: right-of-use assets and corresponding lease liabilities per IFRS 16. Generate entity and consolidated versions. Include prior period comparison. Verify: total assets = total liabilities + equity (accounting equation check).",
