        description: "Update rolling cash flow forecast based on actual results and updated assumptions. Forecast horizon: 13 weeks (detailed weekly) plus 12 months (monthly). Inflows: expected collections (AR aging × collection probability), contract revenue pipeline, D&D collections, and other income. Outflows: vessel operating costs (known schedule), bunker purchases (based on voyage plan), port costs (per vessel calls), crew wages (per manning), lease payments (per schedule), loan repayments (per amortization), tax payments (per filing dates), and capex (per capital budget). Identify: weeks where cash balance drops below minimum threshold (trigger: arrange short-term financing), and periods of excess cash (trigger: consider investment or debt repayment). Update after every month-end with actual data replacing forecasts.",
