        description: "Requestor creates purchase requisition specifying: item description, quantity, required delivery date, estimated cost, cost center/budget code, and business justification. For shipping-specific categories: vessel stores and spares (safety equipment, navigation, engine parts), bunker-related (not fuel itself — that's E2E-27 — but bunker testing, sampling equipment), office supplies, IT equipment, and professional services (class surveys, legal, consultancy). Requisitions auto-route to budget holder based on cost center. System validates: item exists in catalog (if catalog item), estimated cost is reasonable (flagged if >20% above last purchase price), and delivery date is feasible.",
