        description: "Budget holder approves requisition against available budget. DOA (delegation of authority) matrix: department head up to $5,000, operations director up to $25,000, VP/CFO up to $100,000, CEO above $100,000. Review: is the purchase necessary? Is there budget remaining in the cost center? Is the estimated cost reasonable? Can this be consolidated with other pending requisitions for better pricing? For vessel stores: verify urgency (is this a safety-critical item needing expedited procurement?). Rejected requisitions returned to requestor with explanation. Approved requisitions route to procurement for sourcing.",
