        description: "Generate purchase order from approved requisition and vendor selection. PO includes: PO number (auto-generated per sequence), vendor details, item descriptions with specifications, quantities, unit prices, total value, delivery address (office, warehouse, or vessel at specific port), delivery date, payment terms (net 30/60/90), incoterms (FOB, CIF, DDP, etc.), and standard T&C (liability, warranty, dispute resolution). For vessel stores delivery: specify vessel name, port, and expected arrival date. For multi-entity: PO issued from the correct legal entity. System validates: PO total matches approved budget, vendor is active and not suspended, and delivery date is within requisition requirement.",
