        module: "AP", step: "Three-way match (PO → receipt → invoice)", type: "ai", processRef: "PRC-130", executorType: "ai_agent", phase: "Invoice Processing", moduleUrl: "/accounts-payable-vendor-management/three-way-matches",
        description: "Three-way match: compare PO (what we ordered), goods receipt (what we received), and invoice (what vendor charges). Match criteria: line items (description), quantity (PO qty ≥ receipt qty ≥ invoice qty), and unit price (invoice price = PO price ± tolerance). Tolerances: quantity tolerance typically 5% (vendor may ship slightly more or less), price tolerance typically 2% (rounding, minor price adjustments). Match outcomes: full match (all three documents agree within tolerance — auto-approve for payment), partial match (some lines match, some don't — route matched lines, flag discrepant lines), and no match (major discrepancies — route to human gate). For services (no physical receipt): two-way match (PO vs invoice with service acceptance confirmation).",
