        description: "Validate vendor invoice for compliance and correctness beyond the three-way match. Checks: tax invoice compliance (correct format per jurisdiction — ZATCA QR code for KSA, GST e-invoice for India, VAT invoice format for UAE), tax calculation accuracy (VAT/GST amount correct based on rate and taxable amount), vendor bank details unchanged (if different from master — fraud risk flag), currency and FX rate reasonable, and payment terms match contract. For international vendors: check WHT applicability, and verify tax treaty benefits claimed are valid. Flag any suspicious patterns: invoice just below approval threshold, round amounts, or vendor address change coinciding with bank detail change.",
