        description: "Approve bunker supplier selection and authorize PO. Bunker manager confirms: recommended supplier is the best value, price is at or below market benchmark, supplier has no outstanding quality or delivery issues, and delivery window fits vessel schedule. For high-value stems (>$300K): VP Operations co-approval. For emergency bunkering (vessel critical on fuel): expedited approval process (phone confirmation, documented post-facto). Award decision communicated to supplier immediately (bids are time-sensitive — prices may change within hours).",
        assignedRole: "Bunker Manager / VP Operations",
