        description: "Update vessel fuel inventory (ROB) with the accepted delivery quantity. Record: quantity delivered per BDN (or vessel figure if protested), grade delivered, tanks filled, and new total ROB per grade. Recalculate: days of supply (should now exceed minimum requirement), tank utilization (available capacity for future bunkering), and consumption forecast alignment (does new ROB match planned voyage requirement?). If quality was conditionally accepted: note fuel handling instructions (e.g., enhanced purifier operation, reduced consumption rate). Update bunker planning system so future optimization runs use the correct ROB as starting point.",
