        description: "Three-way match for bunker: PO (what we ordered at what price), BDN (what was delivered — quantity confirmed by vessel), and invoice (what supplier charges). Match: quantity (PO vs BDN vs invoice — tolerance ±0.5% for quantity, as bunker measurement inherently has variance), price per MT (invoice must match PO price — no tolerance unless price adjustment clause in contract), and surcharges (must be per agreed terms). Common discrepancies: quantity difference (BDN protest — vessel says less received than supplier claims), price adjustment (market moved between order and delivery — only valid if contract allows), and unagreed surcharges (overtime charges, barging fees not in original quote). Auto-approve if all within tolerance; route to human review if discrepant.",
        assignedRole: "Bunker Match AI Agent",
