        description: "Schedule approved bunker invoice for payment. Bunker payments are typically large ($100K-$2M per stem) and in USD — critical to manage cash flow and FX exposure. Payment terms: net 30 days standard, some suppliers offer 2% discount for payment within 10 days (valuable for large amounts). Schedule per: approved terms, cash position forecast (from treasury), and any quality claim offsets (if off-spec delivery — withhold claimed amount pending resolution). For time-charter vessels: allocate cost to charterer account per charter party bunker clause (typically charterer pays for fuel). Group bunker payments with other vendor payments in the same currency for FX efficiency.",
