        module: "Performance", step: "Consumption vs plan analysis (ongoing)", type: "ai", processRef: "PRC-298", executorType: "ai_agent", phase: "Ongoing Analysis", moduleUrl: "/bunker-fuel-management/reconciliations",
        description: "Continuous analysis of actual fuel consumption vs planned consumption. For each voyage: compare actual consumption (from noon reports) against forecast (from step 2). Analyze variance by: speed factor (was actual speed different from planned?), weather factor (was weather worse/better than forecast?), hull condition factor (is hull fouling worse than assumed?), and auxiliary consumption (was port time longer/shorter than planned?). Cumulative analysis: track fleet-wide consumption efficiency trend, identify best/worst performing vessels, and flag vessels with deteriorating performance (may indicate hull fouling requiring cleaning or engine issues). Output feeds: bunker budget variance analysis, vessel performance monitoring, and future consumption forecasting accuracy improvement.",
