        description: "Settle bunker costs per time charter party bunker clause. Standard TC bunker clause: charterer pays for all fuel consumed during charter period, with: on-delivery bunker survey (charterer buys ROB from owner at agreed/market price at delivery), and off-redelivery bunker survey (owner buys ROB from charterer at agreed/market price at redelivery). During charter: all bunker purchases are for charterer's account. Settlement: calculate bunker cost allocation per hire statement, including: on-delivery bunker value, bunker purchases during charter, bunker consumption per voyage, and off-redelivery bunker value. For disputes: charter party defines measurement method (vessel soundings, typically), pricing reference (Platts, market average), and dispute resolution.",
