        description: "Verify fleet compliance with all six MARPOL annexes for the reporting period. Annex I (Oil Pollution): Oil Record Book entries complete, IOPP Certificate valid, OWS (Oily Water Separator) functioning, 15ppm limit compliance, oil discharge monitoring records. Annex II (Noxious Liquid Substances): NLS Certificate, P&A Manual compliance, tank washing records for cat X/Y/Z substances. Annex III (Harmful Substances in Packaged Form): IMDG Code compliance for hazmat in containers, proper labeling and stowage. Annex IV (Sewage): sewage treatment plant certificates, discharge records (>12nm from land or treated effluent standards). Annex V (Garbage): Garbage Management Plan, garbage record book, no plastics discharged, port reception facility usage. Annex VI (Air Pollution): SOx compliance (0.50% global / 0.10% ECA), NOx Tier compliance per engine, EIAPP Certificate, IAPP Certificate, ozone-depleting substances inventory, VOC management. For each vessel: check certificate validity, record book completeness, and any deficiencies noted during port state inspections.",
