        description: "Create detailed voyage plan for the inaugural and template voyages. Define: port rotation with sailing distances, speed profile per leg (eco speed vs full speed), bunker consumption estimates, weather routing considerations, canal transits (Suez/Panama), and ETA windows per port. Optimize for: fuel cost, transit time competitiveness, and emissions compliance. Template voyage serves as the baseline for all future voyages on this service.",
