        description: "Calculate and set surcharges for the new service. Standard surcharges include: BAF/LSS (bunker adjustment), THC (terminal handling per port), currency adjustment (CAF), peak season surcharge (PSS), war risk / piracy surcharge (if applicable), Suez/Panama canal surcharge, low-sulphur fuel surcharge, and equipment imbalance surcharge. Surcharges must be transparent, justifiable, and competitive with market practice.",
        assignedRole: "Surcharge Calculation AI Agent",
