        description: "Calculate and allocate insurance premiums for the new vessel across all coverage types. H&M premium based on: insured value, vessel age, type, flag, classification society, trading area, and claims history (typically 0.15-0.40% of insured value per annum). P&I premium: based on entered tonnage (GT), vessel type, and club's overall call assessment (advance call + supplementary call). Loss of Hire: based on daily hire rate and selected waiting period/policy period. War Risks: based on trading area risk profile. Calculate total annual insurance cost per vessel, compare against fleet average, and allocate to vessel operating cost budget. Set up premium payment schedule (H&M: typically quarterly; P&I: advance call February 20, supplementary calls as declared).",
