        description: "Update the fleet deployment plan to incorporate the completed transaction. For acquisitions: assign the new vessel to the service loop identified in the strategy decision, schedule the positioning voyage from delivery port to first loading port, arrange crewing (captain, officers, ratings per Safe Manning Certificate), complete pre-operational inspections (ISM DOC, SMC, ISSC), and set the operational start date. For disposals: reassign services from the sold vessel to replacement tonnage, plan the final commercial voyage, schedule vessel cleaning and delivery to buyer per MOA terms. Update all fleet deployment records, vessel schedules, capacity allocations, and notify commercial teams of capacity changes. Trigger downstream updates: booking acceptance windows, rate tariff applicability, and alliance/VSA slot adjustments.",
