        description: "Scheduled AI-powered audit trail analysis covering security, compliance, and operational anomaly detection. The platform logs every significant action: user logins (success/failure with IP, device, location), data modifications (who changed what, old value → new value, timestamp), approval decisions (approved/rejected with reason), financial transactions (all monetary movements with amounts and counterparties), API access (authenticated requests with user, endpoint, method, response code), and system events (config changes, deployment events, backup completions). The AI agent analyzes these audit trails on a daily schedule to detect: security anomalies (unusual login patterns — multiple failed attempts, login from new country, concurrent sessions from different locations; unauthorized access attempts — 403 errors; privilege escalation attempts), compliance violations (segregation of duty breaches — same user created and approved a transaction; missing approvals — transactions processed without required workflow approval; data retention violations), operational anomalies (unusual transaction volumes — 3σ deviation from baseline; unusual working hours activity; bulk data exports), and financial irregularities (unusual payment patterns, round-number transaction clustering, split transactions below approval thresholds). Generate daily security digest for IT admin, weekly compliance report for compliance officer, and monthly executive summary for management. All findings are categorized by severity (critical/high/medium/low) with recommended remediation actions.",
